                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27c72fd9-f46f-3640-a956-0390a3524afa",
                                        "entry_id": "0071400b-38c0-3f99-b7e6-e76add5478b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to fireworks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7246052-b28f-3144-89f5-607809775855",
                                        "entry_id": "0071400b-38c0-3f99-b7e6-e76add5478b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to the use of fire in chemistry or metallurgy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9cba476-7081-3c0f-9d28-71b5b255a0fb",
                                        "entry_id": "0071400b-38c0-3f99-b7e6-e76add5478b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling fireworks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0e9a3c3-429a-4349-a29a-d9abbf472347",
                                                "sense_id": "b9cba476-7081-3c0f-9d28-71b5b255a0fb",
                                                "text": "They had spent much of June and July walking about the plateau near Poronin and discussing Kuba’s pyrotechnic schemes for making money. Possibly because of his bourgeois origins, Hanecki had a remarkable financial flair, and extraordinary grasp of money matters—a quality as valuable as it was rare in a revolutionary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34bfff77-182d-414e-a8f5-fad1b0f8932c",
                                                "sense_id": "b9cba476-7081-3c0f-9d28-71b5b255a0fb",
                                                "text": "[T]he Weston clan, whose dysfunctions are pyrotechnic in their scale and intensity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "559ddaf2-1b01-3a96-ae82-5cb6d8c097ff",
                                        "entry_id": "0071400b-38c0-3f99-b7e6-e76add5478b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to pyrotechny."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e7f3ca0e-431c-4d5d-9ce3-7fdfd16ecb59",
                        "source_entry_id": "8ee2768f-11b9-38ad-817a-022b85de8a06",
                        "source_sense_id": "b432c9d7-7dd3-334d-9556-e57efa7bc2a1",
                        "target_lang_word": "pyrotechnique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pyrotechnique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0af354c2-f0e5-3668-9ca3-d81e4abbd683",
                                        "entry_id": "3038b300-1e8c-3998-b34e-e304ea89fcdb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui appartient à la pyrotechnie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6db07cd-036f-47ab-9c1c-0417e3936bb6",
                                                "sense_id": "0af354c2-f0e5-3668-9ca3-d81e4abbd683",
                                                "text": "Les poudres flash sont des mélanges pyrotechniques non seulement déflagrants, mais aussi détonants. Sur plusieurs centaines de bombes annuellement en cause, il y a environ 15% de cas où il est fait usage de poudres flash."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e9220dc-76b5-442e-a90d-c94b54f6d19d",
                                                "sense_id": "0af354c2-f0e5-3668-9ca3-d81e4abbd683",
                                                "text": "« Le projet de dissolution repose sur un dossier vide, assure Me Frédéric Rollin, en charge de la défense des Supras. Certains des huit griefs imputés n’ont aucun sens. Par exemple, il est reproché à mes clients d’avoir tenté de dégrader des grilles séparatives face à Vesoul. Contre Monaco, il est reproché d’avoir introduit des engins pyrotechniques dans le stade. Si on interdit les associations pour ça, il ne va plus y avoir grand monde dans les stades. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
